WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.460
Hmph. A little Black Cat, huh?

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.040
Leave her to me.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:16.020
We have a well-practised way of
dealing with her kind.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:20.710
Blue Cats are the enemies

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.170
of Black Cats!

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.380
It's my first time seeing Fran like this…

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.290
Fran, what's this about Blue Cats?

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.790
Hundreds of years ago,

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.420
the Blue Cats deceived us,

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.670
and the Black Cats were reduced
to the lowest of all.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.620
Ever since then, they've targeted Black Cats

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.290
and sold us off to the slave traders.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.170
So that's how it was.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.330
So they're Fran's arch-nemesis,

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:50.920
a bunch of wretched ruffians.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.120
Power Perception.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.960
(Lv. 25)

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:06.250
The Thousand Slasher, Gyuran!
He is a hero of the Battle of Lutz!

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.210
He'll cut your head off in an instant!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.460
Are you scared?

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.460
Are you afraid of me?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.710
Fran…

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:29.250
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.290
(Episode 8 The Blue Cats Are Enemies)

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.830
Gyuran, cut her into pieces!

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.540
Are you afraid of me?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.500
Of course, you are.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:16.960
The Black Cats are destined
to be hunted and killed by the Blue Cats!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.500
Fran!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.230
(Illusive Pyroxene Magic Sword)
This sword…

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.330
(Illusive Pyroxene Magic Sword)
Illusive Pyroxene Magic Sword?

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.960
(Illusive Pyroxene Magic Sword)
It's stronger than the Greater Demon's.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.000
Fran, are you all right?

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.540
The Blue Cats…

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.170
When I was still traveling with my parents,

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:41.420
we were attacked many times.
I thought I was going to die then.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.880
Are you still resisting?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.210
Fran!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.210
That bastard!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:04.380
A female Black Cat tried to resist once.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:10.420
I cut off her daughter's ears, limbs, and tail

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:13.920
right in front of her. In that order too.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:19.710
That brat didn't make it and died halfway.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:21.290
This monster…

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.290
I gouged out the eyes of the female

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:28.380
and hung her on the tree,

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.710
and skinned her alive.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.620
The sounds she made
when I tortured her gave me a rush.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.170
I threw her to the wild dogs afterwards.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.880
Have you ever heard it?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.420
The sounds of bones crunching
as one is ripped apart alive.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.710
How pleasant that sounded!

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:48.120
This damned animal!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.170
Will you make me feel even better?

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:53.000
Hey!

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.170
Fran, it's all right.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.210
You're now a Black Cat adventurer
who is aiming to evolve.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:08.330
You're even strong enough
to defeat a Greater Demon now.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.710
Teacher…

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.710
You won't lose to the likes of him.

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.880
I promise.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.750
What's with that look?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.380
Thank you, Teacher.

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:27.580
How dare you look at me like that!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.210
What?

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.710
How many?

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:35.620
Huh?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:39.250
How many Black Cats have you murdered?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.420
Five.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.500
No.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:47.250
Six, seven, eight, nine…

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.460
I didn't bother to keep track after the tenth.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:52.960
That's great.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.380
Now I can kill you without hesitation.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.790
Huh?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.960
It's not as strong as Teacher,
but this is a nice sword too.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.000
I'll be taking this.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.170
My… my sword!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:09.170
No… My wrist!

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.380
I can't store living things
in the Dimension Storage,

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:15.040
but chopped-off limbs are fine.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.790
You damned Black Cat!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.460
You'll pay for your crimes.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.670
I… Impossible!

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.330
I'm supposed to be at a higher level than you…

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.880
Wait, Fran!

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.920
If you must, I'll deliver the killing blow.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.460
Teacher.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:58.330
I want to change the current situation
that Black Cats are being brutally treated.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.580
Fran…

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.500
I want to evolve and show

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:07.710
the other surviving Black Cats
that they can do it, too,

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:09.500
and cheer them up.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.790
But if I let someone like him live on,

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.830
the number of Black Cats
will dwindle even further.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.620
It'll be too late then.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.080
This is something I must go through,

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.290
so I think I must do this on my own.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:30.040
Indeed.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.420
In a place where life is hardly valued,

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:37.330
I can't force Fran to live by
the values of the world I used to live in.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.500
In that case, my responsibility will be…

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.670
I understand.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.920
But use me when you end a life,

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.250
all right?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.380
How can I, a Blue Cat,

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.540
be defeated by a Black Cat…

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.000
This might be some sense of self-satisfaction.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.080
But even if it's only a little,
I want to share some of her burdens…

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.170
Dimensional Storage.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.380
It… It disappeared!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.330
She dismembered Gyuran and made him disappear!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:17.420
What about that zombie over there?
Should we kill him too?

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:20.120
Technically, he isn't a zombie…

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.500
What is that thing?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.460
It looks like I made it in time.
I'm afraid I cannot allow you to kill that man.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:29.750
Guild Master?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.880
This thing here that I used
to find you is a Water Spirit.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.580
Isn't it adorable?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.580
It's weird. It looks like a blob of slime.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.460
I thought it would look more like a human.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:48.080
What? Please do not lump
spirits with the likes of slime!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.710
It is clearly far cuter than any slime could be!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.210
Only superior spirits
can take on the form of humans.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:58.880
We're not at war right now. It would be absurd
to summon a superior spirit at a time like this!

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.080
The guild master's scary.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.290
So he's a spirit maniac…

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.460
That aside,

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:10.670
let's get back to the matter
with August Allsand.

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.330
Forgot all about him.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.960
The adventurers from our guild should have

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.920
escorted him back
to Count Holmes' mansion by now.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:25.120
Count Holmes actually secretly requested us
to find his son and apprehend him.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.620
He was placed under house arrest
for offending royalty,

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.940
but he ran away with a hefty sum of money.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:37.210
So he planned to get revenge
on Fran and make off?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.620
We don't know if he'll be made
to answer for his deeds

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.880
or if he'll be locked away for life
in the dungeon,

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:46.120
but this marks the end of that matter for us.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:48.750
Is something the matter?

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.580
A request… Does that mean there's a reward?

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:57.000
Yes, of course. We'll pay you, plus a bonus.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.380
Seriously?

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.750
But we ask
that you keep this matter a secret.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:07.170
I'm sure you wouldn't want
to get caught up in the nobles' affairs either.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.830
My lips are sealed.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:14.170
Well, then, please pick up your reward
at the counter from Nell.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.330
Okay.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.330
I've returned.

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:19.040
Eh?

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:21.960
Oh, my.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.580
Terribly sorry.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.250
Huh? You…

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.460
I…

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:37.120
I am your mother!

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:41.420
Huh? Really?

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:45.210
This… This lady is Fran's mother?

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.920
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.120
Huh?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.580
Is this your mother, Fran?

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.790
No, she's not!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:58.210
I figured. She doesn't even have cat ears.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.380
And you did mention
that your mother had passed away.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.920
This shouldn't be your reaction.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.420
You may call me mother!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.790
No, I won't!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.080
Huh? What's going on here?

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:25.000
Let go of me!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.920
Oh, what a cold child.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.670
It's all right. Don't be shy.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.080
- Let me go!
- How cute.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.880
I'll let you go if you let me kiss you.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.000
No!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.120
In that case,
I'll just kiss you then.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:44.380
Fran, if you dislike this that much,
just break free from her hold.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:47.330
I can't, Teacher!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.500
She's strong!

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.420
Eh?

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.380
That's enough, Amanda.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:56.290
I'm aware of your fondness for children,
but please do not go overboard.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.170
Got it.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.920
Amanda? Isn't that…

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.790
Sorry, I was too excited
and got a little carried away.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:05.380
This lady here is an A-rank adventurer.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:08.040
Despite how she carries herself,
she is the ace of our guild.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.960
- A-rank?
- A-rank?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:12.460
This elf lady is an A-rank adventurer?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.330
I must check her stats!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.750
(Name: Amanda, Age: 58)
Eh? 58 years old?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.080
(Titles: Guardian of Children)
She's a half-elf…

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.370
(Magic Whip of Celestial Dragon Beard)
She looks young,

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.370
(Magic Whip of Celestial Dragon Beard)
but I suppose they have a longer lifespan…

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.330
(Equipment: Thunderbird Feather Accessory)
But her stats are crazy.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.420
(Unique Skill: Spirit's Affection)
I doubt we can win even if we go all out against her.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.540
A-rank adventurers are no joke…

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.960
If I recall correctly,

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.290
you must be Fran.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.080
How do you know my name?

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.750
You're the talk of the lobby.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:45.040
The little Black Cat newbie
who soloed the goblin dungeon,

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.120
right?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:53.380
I sent her to investigate
the unnatural ongoings in the Marou Plains.

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.670
Ah, the problem I caused.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:59.040
That's why I'm here to report my findings.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.960
It's a troublesome matter indeed.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.540
Now, now…

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.210
Very sorry!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.170
Sorry about this. I'll see you around, Fran.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.330
Nothing to be sorry about. Goodbye.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.040
Oh, it's you, Fran.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.080
Are you here to gather herbs for a quest?

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.790
What a coincidence!

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:31.290
Where can I find another dungeon
that's close to Alessa?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:35.620
I believe that would be
the dungeon near Ulmutt.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.330
Ulmutt.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.540
I'll consider it.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.830
Oh, we meet again.

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.500
One cotton candy, please.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.420
Oh, what a coincidence!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.750
Oh, hello again.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.750
Oh, another coincidence!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.000
Oh, fancy seeing you here.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.460
Oh, hello again…

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.580
We're being stalked.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:33.540
What exactly does she want from us?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.330
Nell…

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:38.580
That person is following me everywhere…

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.670
I think she has taken a liking to you, Fran.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.500
Is she a weird person?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.290
Amanda is a little weird,

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.750
but she isn't a bad person.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.120
Despite how she appears to be,

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.620
she has been running an orphanage
since she was very young

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.620
to help take care
of the less fortunate children.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.080
- Amanda!
- Amanda!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:04.330
That is how she was given
the title of Guardian of Children.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:09.080
A title is given to a person
by the gods for their actions.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:12.380
So even if it might be a little hard to believe,

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:16.460
her love and care for children
are approved of even by the gods.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:19.040
As difficult as
that might be for you to believe.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.620
Has she been doing that
because she's concerned for Fran?

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.250
Are you talking bad about me behind my back?

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.040
Amanda!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:31.670
What? Don't use your skills
to sneak up on me like that!

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.120
Hey, that's the A-rank adventurer,
Miss Amanda.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.880
It's the first time I've seen her in person.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:39.420
You better not stare at her for long,
or she'll get mad.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.460
I heard them say

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.540
that heads will roll
if you stare at her for over three seconds.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.420
Eh?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.750
She looks so lovely,
but she's actually that scary?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.080
That reminds me, Fran,

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:53.210
we sure have been running into each other a lot.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:55.290
Liar. It's because you've been stalking me.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:59.380
Nothing of the sort!
Seriously, that's not true at all.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:04.830
Fran, when you've sorted out your feelings,

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.670
you can call me mother any time.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.250
I won't.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:12.250
Oh, right. Fran, the guild master
has asked you to see him.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.170
Wait… Who's there?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.880
I'm here.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:24.880
Miss Fran, please announce yourself properly
before you enter.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.710
You've been asking to see me a lot lately.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.380
Now, now. Don't make that face.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.380
So what do you need to see me for?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.250
Well, I can assure you
that it's nothing bad for you.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.120
Crystals!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.830
These are the crystals I collected
when I was still an active adventurer.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.460
Interested?

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:48.330
Every one of these came
from monsters ranked D or higher.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.670
I want those huge crystals!

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.580
But I sense a catch…

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.080
Are you giving them to me?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.710
Well,

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:59.250
I'll let you have two of them.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.790
But

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.840
only on the condition
that you accept a request.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:05.840
A request?

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.160
I would like you
to investigate the spider's nest,

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:12.500
a dungeon nearby Alessa.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.750
Dungeon?

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.640
Spider's nest?

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:16.160
I'll accept it for ten crystals.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.360
Eh?

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.750
What… You're asking for too much!

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.250
Three. How about three?

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.160
Eight.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:27.160
Eight? That's too many!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.750
What do you say about four?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.750
Six.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.790
No, no, no… Four is the highest I can go.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:36.330
I can't let you have any more than that!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:38.580
Goodbye then.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.120
Fine! Five it is!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.710
Will you really give me five crystals?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.960
Nothing more than that. I mean it.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:52.250
All right. I want the five crystals upfront.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.380
You're quite good at bargaining, Fran.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:59.500
I've been forced to compromise…

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.170
But why is he so persistent?

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:05.120
Why do you want me to
investigate that dungeon so badly?

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:08.920
There were more adventurers
that were skeptical about your promotion

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.040
to D-rank than I expected.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.380
You're the one who decided to give me that rank.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.120
It pains me to hear you say that.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.460
There are those who say
that you bought your way to that rank.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:24.250
And rumors are going around
that I have a thing for little girls.

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.830
How… How absurd!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.170
It seems he really doesn't like people
saying that he has a thing for little girls.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:37.420
In any case, I would like you
to take on this D-rank quest

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.330
to put an end to those baseless rumors.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.380
What do you think, Teacher?

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:46.500
In addition, if you complete this request,

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.830
I'll issue you a pass to enter
the dungeon in Ulmutt.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.710
How did you know I wanted to go to Ulmutt?

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.710
Well, I am the guild master, after all.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:59.000
Nothing discussed in public in Alessa
escapes my ears, whether you like it or not.

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.120
I think we should accept it.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.620
All right. I accept.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:13.620
Oh, my, what a coincidence! I just
so happened to overhear your conversation.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.040
I shall be going too.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.960
Eh…

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.620
I knew it.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:27.540
Most of the adventurers
that'll be going are male!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.330
Now, stop right there…

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.500
There are designated levels
for these requests…

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.750
I will be joining the investigation.

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.120
Alright, OK then.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.750
Curry! Curry!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.580
The spider's nest, huh?

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:48.040
Teacher, will there be strong monsters
inside the spider's nest?

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.040
Hey, no talking while your mouth is full.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:55.500
Will there be strong monsters
inside the spider's nest?

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.580
I wonder.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.080
It's a dungeon that has already been cleared.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.620
The request only wants us
to collect the materials inside the nest.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:07.330
I think the chances of encountering
a monster as strong as a Greater Demon are low.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.750
That sounds boring.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:13.750
Now, now, the guild master said he would
give us a pass to enter the dungeon in Ulmutt,

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.620
so let's do it as a favor to him.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.830
After all, he gave us all these crystals.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:23.080
What crystals are these?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.830
According to Appraisal,

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.080
(Fortified Hermit Crab, Trident Shark, Sealion)
Three from D-rank monsters

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.920
(Red Colossus, Old Yeti)
and two from C-rank monsters.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:34.330
All of them are from monsters
I've never heard of.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.330
Now, then, without further ado,

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.460
thank you for the meal!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.210
Crystals absorbed!

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:44.830
Self-Evo activated.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:48.000
45 Self-Evo points acquired.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:51.460
(Self-Evo Rank 8)
Here it comes! The long-waited rank-up!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.960
(Self-Evo Rank 9)
Teacher, your stats went up!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.080
What skills did you get from the crystals?

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:59.170
Let's see…

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:03.420
(Swimming, Water Manipulation, Berserk)
I got quite a few water-based skills.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:08.960
I absorbed all of those crystals,
so I've gotten a bunch of skills.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:12.330
It might take a bit to master all of them…

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.960
(Kin Summon 6)
Kin Summon?

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.460
Oh, it's the skill we obtained
from the Army Beetle Leader.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.670
Kin…

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.420
Does that mean we can summon
allies or familiars?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.960
I would like to try it out.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.420
In any case, this will be our second dungeon.

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:33.000
Now that we've become stronger,
we should be able to take it on.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.920
Let's do our best!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:41.330
We were supposed to
have become stronger...

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:48.420
Mizuchi Strike.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:51.620
Dodge! Dodge it, Fran!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.790
But…

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:03.170
I didn't expect it would turn out like that.

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.080
(Next Episode
The A-Rank Adventurer Is a Monster)
